  "source": "## Semantics: E2 (recovery — the R1.5 partial-tree differential input)\ngrammar RecoveryKV version \"1.0.0\" mode \"v1\" {\n  ## key = value ; pairs\n  pair = ( 1*( %x61-7A / %x30-39 ) ) as k \"=\" ( 1*( %x30-39 ) ) as v \";\"\n  document = 1*( pair )\n  entry main: document\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"a=1;b=2;\"\n    reject \"a=1;b=2;c=3\"\n  }\n}\n",
